{"speciesId":533,"names":{"fr":"Ouvrifier","es":"Gurdurr","en":"Gurdurr","ja":"ドテッコツ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Même une armée de catcheurs se jetant sur son corps hyper musclé ne le ferait pas ciller."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"This Pokémon is so muscular and strongly built that even a group of wrestlers could not make it budge an inch."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il entretient sa forme en transportant une poutre en acier et fait des concours de culturisme avec ses camarades."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"They strengthen their bodies by carrying steel beams. They show off their big muscles to their friends."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"With strengthened bodies, they skillfully wield steel beams to take down buildings."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"With strengthened bodies, they skillfully wield steel beams to take down buildings."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ce Pokémon hyper musclé manipule avec habileté les poutres métalliques et peut démanteler un immeuble en un clin d’œil."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Gracias a su entrenada musculatura, puede blandir vigas de acero sin problema para así derribar edificios enteros."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"With strengthened bodies, they skillfully wield steel beams to take down buildings."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"鍛えあげた 筋肉の 持ち主。 鉄骨を たくみに 操って 一軒家を 解体してくれる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Même une armée de catcheurs se jetant sur son corps hyper musclé ne le ferait pas ciller."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Sus músculos están tan desarrollados que no se inmuta aunque lo ataquen varios luchadores."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"This Pokémon is so muscular and strongly built that even a group of wrestlers could not make it budge an inch."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"鍛え上げられた 筋肉の 体は プロレスラーが 束に なって 攻撃しても びくとも しない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ce Pokémon hyper musclé manipule avec habileté les poutres métalliques et peut démanteler un immeuble en un clin d’œil."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Gracias a su entrenada musculatura, puede blandir vigas de acero sin problema para así derribar edificios enteros."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"With strengthened bodies, they skillfully wield steel beams to take down buildings."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"鍛えあげた 筋肉の 持ち主。 鉄骨を たくみに 操って 一軒家を 解体してくれる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Même une armée de catcheurs se jetant sur son corps hyper musclé ne le ferait pas ciller."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sus músculos están tan desarrollados que no se inmuta aunque lo ataquen varios luchadores."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"This Pokémon is so muscular and strongly built that even a group of wrestlers could not make it budge an inch."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"鍛え上げられた 筋肉の 体は プロレスラーが 束に なって 攻撃しても びくとも しない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il participe à des concours de gonflette avec ses congénères et les Machopeur. Le perdant ne se montre plus en public pendant quelque temps."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"A menudo realiza competiciones de fuerza con sus congéneres y con los Machoke. El perdedor debe pasar un tiempo sin dejarse ver."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It shows off its muscles to Machoke and other Gurdurr. If it fails to measure up to the other Pokémon, it lies low for a little while."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"仲間や ゴーリキーと 筋肉を 自慢 しあう。 負けたほうは しばらく 姿を 見せなくなる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il manie la poutre métallique avec habileté. Il est doué pour démanteler une bâtisse, mais peu adroit lorsqu’il s’agit d’en construire une."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Blande vigas de acero con gran de